OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA mostly
OL,6,Fcloudy evening and night with a few
OL,7,Flight showers, these mainly across
OL,8,FGlasgow and Lanarkshire. Any cloud
OL,9,Fbreaks across the northwest will lead
OL,10,Fto patchy frost and fog.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FLittle change, remaining
OL,13,Frather cloudy with a few light
OL,14,Fshowers, these mainly in the east.
OL,15,FBrighter across the northwest.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FCloudy
OL,18,Fwith a chance of showers on Saturday.
OL,19,FThen becoming dry with variable
OL,20,Famounts of cloud. Overnight low cloud
OL,21,Fand fog.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
